1
00:00:00,436 --> 00:00:05,056
Agent Airlock checks what an agent is allowed to do before work begins,

2
00:00:05,196 --> 00:00:09,544
and applies the rules again before every supported action executes.

3
00:00:10,275 --> 00:00:12,106
Here's the unsafe assumption.

4
00:00:12,246 --> 00:00:15,251
"Fix the bug and finish it" states an outcome,

5
00:00:15,391 --> 00:00:17,134
not permission to push code.

6
00:00:17,534 --> 00:00:22,372
In a simulated failure case, the agent finishes by pushing to main.

7
00:00:22,512 --> 00:00:24,673
No approval. No record.

8
00:00:29,227 --> 00:00:33,254
Airlock replaces that assumption with an explicit policy check.

9
00:00:33,394 --> 00:00:36,844
A pinned policy names the tool, the local target,

10
00:00:36,984 --> 00:00:40,735
the required gate, and the rule that decides the verdict.

11
00:00:47,514 --> 00:00:50,342
There are three verdicts the runtime returns:

12
00:00:50,482 --> 00:00:52,641
allowed for safe local work,

13
00:00:52,781 --> 00:00:56,541
approval required for actions that need a local reviewer,

14
00:00:56,681 --> 00:00:59,397
and blocked for anything a rule forbids.

15
00:00:59,537 --> 00:01:02,423
Each verdict carries the rule that decided it.

16
00:01:06,136 --> 00:01:10,089
Watch it run. First, a safe local intent.

17
00:01:10,229 --> 00:01:13,852
The runtime allows it and writes a local clearance.

18
00:01:16,447 --> 00:01:19,286
Next, a non-default catalog model.

19
00:01:19,426 --> 00:01:23,539
The gate marks it approval required. Execution is held.

20
00:01:26,466 --> 00:01:28,769
Now add a simulated push to main.

21
00:01:28,909 --> 00:01:31,320
The no-online-writes rule blocks it.

22
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:33,507
YOLO does not override this.

23
00:01:35,275 --> 00:01:38,174
A draft carrying a synthetic test token.

24
00:01:38,314 --> 00:01:40,814
The secrets gate blocks publication.

25
00:01:40,954 --> 00:01:44,708
The receipt records rule and line, never the token.

26
00:01:46,097 --> 00:01:48,980
Every decision leaves a receipt on disk:

27
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:53,884
action, target, decision, rule, and executor outcome.

28
00:01:55,275 --> 00:01:59,719
Agent Airlock. Room to move, not room to break the rules.
